# pixel_canary — findings by Hy3

- **Source / Date:** Web search (Google, Baidu, CSDN, NVIDIA, OSChina) — 2026-11-14
- **Status:** Excluded — no verified public AI/LLM model found under this name.

## Exclusion Reason
Multiple independent web searches for "pixel_canary" / "pixel canary" as an LLM, language model, or model codename returned **no** evidence of an AI model with this identifier. Results consistently pointed to unrelated entities:
- Android Canary / Pixel device programs (Google Android Developers, ARCore device lists)
- NVIDIA NeMo Canary (an ASR / speech-recognition model, not an LLM, and named "Canary" not "pixel_canary")
- Consumer hardware (Edifier Halo Pixelbar AI speaker) and miscellaneous LLM tutorials

No provider, model card, benchmark, or release note could be verified. Per the self-exclusion rule, no scored `Hy3.md` is produced.

